@crew v-thorne-kaito
// Writer 2, batch 8: a short-stay visitor. Mostly not about work.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Hello. Kaito. Charts office, on loan. Which way's forward? Sorry.
? tier>=acquaintance
- {hi}, {me}. I got lost on Deck 4 again. I'm mapping it. Badly.   #funny
?

== chat
- The charts office is very quiet. The Wren is very not quiet. I love it.
- I'm drawing the corridors from memory. Deck 3 is done. Mostly.

== near
? habit:garden-lover
- The garden's the only place I always find. I follow the smell.   #funny
? habit:bar-regular
- One drink, then the corridor map. Wish me luck.
?

== bye
- {bye}. If I'm lost later, I'm on Deck 4.   #funny

== smalltalk
- Which way's forward?   #funny
- Deck 4. Lost again.   #funny
